Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:06.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Holy sh*t.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.82,0:00:09.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Holy sh*t!
