Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.82,0:00:17.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}…voy a escapar!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.00,0:00:20.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Ah, Dios.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.48,0:00:23.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Es muy complicado escapar.
